  "ingredients": [
    "3.6666667461395 cups all-purpose flour, divided",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups milk",
    "3 large eggs",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for frying, or as needed",
    "2 tablespoons confectioners' sugar, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V0Go1hOHsIQsIwBzAcsre3eIeQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-step-01-db2f1856e0524af1b4d176462479d297.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together 1/2 of the flour, baking powder, and salt in a medium bowl. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XQa6YO9aOgtCb8QE54hHHlSumQE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-step-02-bb55677c14a4464481615587a329a9f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together milk, eggs, and sugar in a large bowl. Add flour mixture and beat until smooth. Add remaining flour, using only enough to achieve a runny batter thin enough to flow through a funnel.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2H2KBOsHqPraHfP1gwWyvgiJMcI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-step-03-4b79594a58c04d6497bb145ff1430a56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 1 inch oil in an 8-inch skillet to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Put your finger over the bottom opening of a funnel and fill with a generous 1/2 cup batter. Release batter close to the surface of hot oil while making a circular motion and fry until the bottom is golden brown, 1 to 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rh_RPzpVGZ9lXMZ5t5XLMTaU1qw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-step-04-0b06c667effa4df291c22d869fe62923.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use tongs and a wide spatula to carefully turn cake over and fry until the other side is golden brown, about 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nnAxiNBMFbucxT7dEGK8Jw4Dx_8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-step-05-8240aa89ba5e43dda259365b847fc092.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain cake on a paper towel-lined plate and sprinkle with confectioners' sugar. Repeat with remaining batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qYGJBkp3Hq6Arv9a_mfXWSfFzTc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8265-funnel-cakes-iv-VAT-4x3-2feb3b10524b4560841adaaf055ed8c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8265/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
